id: pm-screen-31bz
title: Keep required CI check names stable under exact Node pins
description: "Branch protection requires test (22) and test (26), but the exact-version matrix reports test (22.19.0) and test (26.0.0), so every pull request stays BLOCKED with all checks green (Dependabot 2 and 3 included)."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[2]: branch-protection,ci
