completed_at: "2026-11-09T17:30:06.000Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: The test job reports test (22) and test (26); the audit test requires exactly 22.19.0 and 26.0.0 and the major-only job name; mutating a major fails it.
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-09T10:24:42.378Z","harness:claude-code",audit.test.ts 4/4 with the include matrix; mutating major 26 to 25 fails 1. Same fix as pm-case a56d4b5 (pm-case#1 was BLOCKED the same way).
  "2026-11-09T12:40:52.923Z","harness:claude-code","CodeRabbit PRRT_kwDOVll0Ws61QETs and PRRT_kwDOVll0Ws61QET1: the audit now requires CI setup-node to use matrix.node-version (release jobs may still pin the floor), and checks the test job's own name key instead of matching anywhere in the file. Mutations: a fixed 22.19.0 in CI setup-node fails 1, and moving the right name into a comment while the job uses the patch version fails 1; restored 4/4."
  "2026-11-09T13:41:57.499Z","harness:claude-code","CodeRabbit PRRT_kwDOVll0Ws61RYA4 and PRRT_kwDOVll0Ws61RYBC: every CI assertion now reads the test job's own block (name, matrix include, setup-node), and the job must contain at least one setup-node step that uses matrix.node-version. Mutations: removing the setup-node step fails 1; moving the right matrix text into a comment outside the job while the job pins 26.1.0 fails 1; restored 4/4."
  "2026-11-14T10:14:23.212Z",codex-sweep-1114,"Release-attribution correction: completed_at = 2026-11-09T17:30:06Z from https://github.com/unbraind/pm-screen/pull/4 (merge SHA 6736825f7ef9aed7d57e0136ed2f362e3caece6e); no fetched release tag contains that merge commit, so release remains unset and this work is genuinely unreleased."
